lisa-design:
- Init returns (nil, errPluginNotConfigured) when parsedConfig is nil, matching plugin-k8s and plugin-cloud-custodian ("plugin not configured"), instead of defaulting a config: an unconfigured plugin has no organization to describe, and the agent always calls Configure first.
- Eval guards parsedConfig AND githubClient (both are set together by Configure; a failed Configure decode leaves them unset) and returns FAILURE + errPluginNotConfigured. The Fetch*/eval*/EvaluatePolicies helpers are only reachable over gRPC through Eval, so they are not guarded individually (existing unit tests call them directly with a partial plugin).
- Configure is unchanged; Init behaviour after Configure is unchanged (same dependabot-repository subject template).

